      "description": "A black-and-white meme featuring an elderly man in military gear as the central subject. The scene includes overlaid text that reads 'chuck norris?' and 'never heard of her.' The text is positioned above and below the man's image, creating a humorous and misogynistic context. The man's serious expression and military attire contrast with the absurdity of the text, forming the core of the meme's composition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
