      "label": "Gendered Misrepresentation",
      "description": "The meme humorously misrepresents Chuck Norris, a male action star, by implying he is a woman ('her'), which is a gendered misrepresentation. This requires external knowledge of gender roles and the cultural context in which such misrepresentations are used for comedic effect, often reinforcing gendered assumptions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
