      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "male_action_star",
      "label": "Male Action Star",
      "description": "Chuck Norris is a male action star, and the meme's joke is built on the assumption that he is a male figure whose gender is being humorously denied or misrepresented. This requires external knowledge of the cultural archetype of the male action star and how such figures are often associated with masculinity and toughness.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
