      "instance_name": "humor_through_gendered_misrepresentation",
      "label": "Humor Through Gendered Misrepresentation",
      "description": "The humor in the meme arises from the gendered misrepresentation of Chuck Norris as 'her,' which is a form of comedic trope that relies on the audience's understanding of gender roles and stereotypes. This requires external knowledge of comedic tropes and how they are used to create humor through misrepresentation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
