    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_ffe21c60",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals familiar with Chuck Norris as a male action star and who understand the comedic trope of gendered misrepresentation. The meme relies on cultural knowledge of Chuck Norris's public persona and the stereotype that women are unfamiliar or unknown to the speaker, which is a form of misogynous humor. The audience is expected to recognize the absurdity of misrepresenting a male figure as 'her' and find the joke humorous through this gendered misrepresentation. The visual of an elderly man in military gear, combined with the text, is designed to appeal to those who appreciate internet memes that use shock value and stereotype-based humor, particularly those who are aware of Chuck Norris's status as a male action icon.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
